necting and disconnecting free tariff internet usage\r\n\u2022 Removing credit lines from the blacklist of charging pin entry\r\n\u2022 Activating and deactivating roaming services, caller ID, voicemail, call limit and advertising and notification SMS\r\n\u2022 Viewing the active waiting voice of the user and the possibility of searching in the waiting voices and activating and deactivating the voice\r\n\u2022 Viewing the user's active content services and the possibility of searching the provided content services and activating and deactivating the services\r\n\u2022 View service offices around the user and the state of internet coverage on the map and the possibility of testing the internet speed\r\n\u2022 The possibility of contacting support (conversation, SMS and email) or requesting users to contact support\r\n\u2022 Participating in surveys and providing suggestions and criticisms\r\n\u2022 Management of active user sessions\r\n\u2022 Biometric entry into the system",
